-3.  **Gradient Computation:**
-    For each pixel $p$ in the mini-batch, the rendered color $\hat{C}(p)$ is computed via alpha-blending of sorted projected Gaussians:
-    $$ \hat{C}(p) = \sum_{i=1}^{M} c_i T_i o_i G_i(p) $$
